        "description": "<p>With this plugin you can translate WordPress from (Serbian, Russian, Bullgarian, Macedonian, Ukrainian, Greek, Makedonian, Armenian, Georgian, Kazakh) cyrillic to latin</p>\n<p>Available language :<br />\nEnglish</p>\n<p>To contribute in translating this plugin contact me : cvijetin.maletich@gmail.com</p>\n",
